  voice:
    dialogue:
    - line: Yep, gonna feel that one in the morning.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 225f7139a94b58144a072df1d2c4f9fd, type: 3}
    - line: I thought pain was supposed to be weakness leaving the body. Why doesn't it feel like weakness is leaving my body?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9972ec37a5269544b93fcb3e0fa5b4ec, type: 3}
    - line: Who hurt you?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 18aa5f05ae3a8534c9f34286d7688c7d, type: 3}
    - line: How about a water break?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c105306d861093e4295470f7db084009, type: 3}
    - line: Ouch, who thought a video g- er, person would hurt so much?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 329c98256c98cf74eb7b8c2e9922506c, type: 3}
    - line: It's pretty cool that I'm able to do dialogue with you!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 83213a938f231a7489e6b72b85e34d03, type: 3}
    - line: Well well well, look what the game dragged in.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0368d541fd41de24cac25fea49b6b999, type: 3}
    - line: Ha ha. You just walked into the bull K3N... Oh that sucked. Can I take it back?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b7b7ddd880b27464fbcfd8a7bc79fc4a, type: 3}
    - line: I never did understand what you meant when you said that.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b356a965940d7114b8c48b44b1e0e812, type: 3}
    - line: "You\u2019re exactly how I imagined."
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bff3b61af5811b047a32e76a839b7c10, type: 3}
    - line: Man, I could really go for a cheeseburger right about now.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 505fc72b7c881e241ac2677e920e8d32, type: 3}
    - line: Scoreboard! Scoreboard!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9c3db63c274cf9846b7b6c739981ae9a, type: 3}
    - line: Let's gooo! That's the way K3N does things.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0190971e4f2d3ee48b4f5bf2c64df52f, type: 3}
    - line: Hey, at least I'm not Ruy.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1d1713833b7c4da42b452106edff6a71, type: 3}
    - line: You know, I was the top scorer in my old life, it only stands to reason that I'd be the top scorer in this life too.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 19af5a594228e4149af7a25138ef2dca, type: 3}
